{"abstract":[{"text":"A set of sequences kept in a radix tree (Morrison, 1968): a trie in which every chain of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vertices with one child and no key is merged into one edge labelled with all its symbols.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Tries\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/Tries\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/Tries\/Se","doc:\/\/Tries\/SE","doc:\/\/Tries\/SQ","doc:\/\/Tries\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/Tries\/s25ExpressibleByArrayLiteralP","doc:\/\/Tries\/SH","doc:\/\/Tries\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Tries\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/Tries\/ST","doc:\/\/Tries\/s10SetAlgebraP"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RadixTree"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Symbol"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Symbol"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Hashable"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It holds the same keys and answers the same queries as "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", with the same names, but has"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a vertex per key and per branching point rather than per symbol: O("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":") vertices for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" keys,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"however long they are. That suits keys with long shared prefixes, such as file paths or URLs."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Lookup, insertion and removal follow the key down from the root, O("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"m","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" + "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"d","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"·"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"σ","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":") for a key of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"m"}]},{"type":"text","text":" symbols that passes "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"d"}]},{"type":"text","text":" vertices of at most "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"σ"}]},{"type":"text","text":" children."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let paths = RadixTree([\"\/usr\/bin\", \"\/usr\/lib\", \"\/usr\/local\/bin\"])","paths.contains(\"\/usr\/lib\")                                   \/\/ true","paths.elements(withPrefix: \"\/usr\/l\").map { String($0) }      \/\/ [\"\/usr\/lib\", \"\/usr\/local\/bin\"]","paths.longestPrefix(of: \"\/usr\/bin\/swift\").map { String($0) } \/\/ \"\/usr\/bin\""],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Iteration visits each key before the keys it is a prefix of. When the symbols are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Comparable"},{"type":"text","text":", each vertex keeps its children sorted, so the keys come in lexicographic order;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"otherwise children come in the order they were first added."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The vertices live in flat arrays with "},{"code":"Int32","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" links, and the edge labels are slices of one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"buffer of symbols, so the tree holds fewer than 2³¹ − 1 vertices and label symbols, and copying"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it copies a few arrays only when one copy is mutated."}]}]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RadixTree","kind":"identifier"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/GrafluentCollections\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Tries\/RadixTree.swift#L27","fileName":"RadixTree.swift"},"title":"RadixTree","externalID":"s:5Tries9RadixTreeV","modules":[{"name":"Tries"}],"symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RadixTree"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/PrefixView"],"title":"Structures","generated":true,"anchor":"Structures"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/init()","doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/init(_:)"],"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/count","doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/isEmpty"],"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/contains(_:)-39nls","doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/elements(withPrefix:)","doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/hasPrefix(_:)","doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/insert(_:)-3ywij","doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/longestPrefix(of:)","doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/remove(_:)-3svqg"],"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Tries\/documen